node_modules/
dist/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated by `npm run icon`
build/icon.png

# The busybox build behind the Windows sed/awk fallback is committed, not
# fetched: a release must not depend on a third-party host being reachable, and
# one build already timed out against frippery.org mid-release. It stays pinned
# by SHA256, and a test asserts the committed bytes still match that pin.
#
# Contents are excluded rather than the directory itself, because git will not
# descend into an excluded directory and the negation below would never apply.
# sed.exe and awk.exe are derived from busybox.exe at build time, so they stay
# out.
vendor/*
!vendor/win/
vendor/win/*
!vendor/win/busybox.exe
